# Unnerving Grasp's "up to one target": cast with no target (CR 601.2c) it returns nothing but still manifests dread (CR 608.2c, the
# sentences are separate): the Elves goes face down as a 2/2, the Bolt to the graveyard, and Bot2's Ornithopter stays on the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Unnerving Grasp
Island x4
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter x4
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Unnerving Grasp.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Llanowar Elves | Lightning Bolt)

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Island; Ornithopter
Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDown = true
Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDownName = Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Graveyard = Unnerving Grasp; Lightning Bolt
